# Old Squarespace URLs -> this site.
#
# Read by Netlify and by Cloudflare Pages, same format on both. This file is
# what keeps the links that are already in the wild working the day the domain
# moves off Squarespace. The old site had exactly five indexed pages plus a
# cart; every one of them is accounted for below.
#
#   200 = rewrite. The visitor keeps the old URL in the address bar and gets
#         the new page. Use it where the page still exists here.
#   301 = permanent move. Use it where the URL should be retired.

# --- the pages that still exist -------------------------------------------
# /bourbon is the one that has been shared most, so it stays a real URL.
/bourbon              /bourbon.html          200
/privacy-policy       /privacy.html          200

# --- the pages that moved --------------------------------------------------
/home                 /                      301
/contact              /buy.html              301

# --- clean URLs for this site's own pages ----------------------------------
# Both hosts already serve /buy for buy.html, but saying so makes it certain
# and means a link written either way works.
/collectors-box       /collectors-box.html   200
/heritage             /heritage.html         200
/founders             /founders.html         200
/partnerships         /partnerships.html     200
/buy                  /buy.html              200
/privacy              /privacy.html          200

# --- MERCHANDISE: DECIDE THIS BEFORE YOU MOVE THE DOMAIN -------------------
# /merchandise and /cart were a live Squarespace store. They stop working the
# moment DNS points here. The 302s below are a stopgap, not an answer — 302 is
# deliberate so nothing caches while you decide. Pick one:
#
#   a) merch moves to Kentucky Bourbon Direct
#         /merchandise  https://foundersrevolution250.kybourbondirect.com/  301
#   b) merch stays on Squarespace at a subdomain
#         /merchandise  https://shop.foundersrevolution250.com/merchandise  301
#         /cart         https://shop.foundersrevolution250.com/cart         301
#   c) merch is retired — delete these two lines and let them 404 properly
#
/merchandise          /                      302
/cart                 /                      302
